@startuml
title Uploading a file with a presigned URL

box "Interface"
  actor Person
  participant "Upload dialog" as Dialog
end box

box "Application"
  participant "Upload API" as Api
  participant "Virus scan function" as Scan
end box

box "Infrastructure"
  database "Postgres metadata DB" as Db
  collections "S3 uploads bucket" as Bucket
  queue "SQS scan queue" as Queue
end box

Person -> Dialog : Drops a file
note right : The dialog never holds AWS credentials.
Dialog -> Api : Requests upload slot
note right : Only filename, type and size are sent.
Api -> Db : Inserts pending row
Api --> Dialog : Returns presigned URL
note right : The URL is signed, scoped to one object and expires quickly.
Dialog -> Bucket : PUT file bytes
note right : The bytes skip the app servers entirely.
Bucket -> Queue : Emits object created event
Queue -> Scan : Delivers scan job
Scan -> Bucket : Reads object
Scan -> Db : Marks file clean
Api --> Dialog : Reports upload ready
@enduml
